# rst.cpptraj.in -- hydrophobic-core DISANG for chignolin (1UAO)
#
#   cpptraj -i rst.cpptraj.in
#
# Every `rst ... out hy.disang` in this file APPENDS one &rst record, so the
# order below is the order of the DISANG -- and that order is what hy.indxf's
# `GROUPS 32 88 44` slices.  Do not reorder or insert lines.
#
# Flat-bottomed well: free to 5 A, quadratic to 7 A, linear beyond.
# rk = 0.29876 kcal/mol/A^2 = 250 kJ/mol/nm^2 (the K in hy.indxf).
#
# Each mask must select exactly ONE atom: a mask matching two or more atoms
# makes cpptraj write a center-of-mass group restraint (IGR1/IGR2) instead of
# 1 atom-atom distance.

parm 1uao.prmtop

